.B \-\-route\-on\-stall
Escalate to the strong model when the fast one stalls (default)
.TP
.B \-\-no\-route\-on\-stall
Don't escalate on a model stall
.TP
.B \-\-route\-on\-context <pct>
Escalate when the history reaches pct% of the
fast tier's window (default 75; needs a roomier
strong tier to have any effect)
.TP
.B \-\-no\-route\-on\-context
Don't escalate on context pressure
.TP
.B \-\-timeout\-connect <s>
Model\-call connect timeout, seconds (0/off disables)
.TP
.B \-\-timeout\-stall <s>
Abort a model stream stalled for this many seconds
.TP
.B \-\-timeout\-request <s>
Hard cap on a whole model call, seconds (0/off = none)
.TP
.B \-\-run\-timeout <s>
Wall\-clock cap on a model\-run shell command, seconds (0 = none)
.TP
.B \-\-no\-markdown
Don't render markdown/syntax in the TUI (raw text)
.TP
.B \-\-type\-ahead
Collect keys typed while the agent works, apply at its next step
.TP
.B \-\-no\-type\-ahead
Don't (the default; see docs/TYPE_AHEAD.md)
.TP
.B \-\-accessible
Reduce motion, keep output screen\-reader\-friendly (docs/ACCESSIBILITY.md)
.TP
.B \-\-no\-fuzzy\-edit
Require exact\-string edits (disable whitespace/anchor fallback)
.TP
.B \-\-bell
Ring the terminal bell when a turn / \-\-auto run finishes
.TP
.B \-\-notify <cmd>
Run <cmd> on completion ($JICHI_NOTIFY, $JICHI_CWD)
